==French==

===Etymology===
Probably from {{inh|fr|fro|ancor}}, from  {{der|fr|LL.|[[in]] [[hanc]] [[hōram]]||until this hour}}. Compare {{cog|ca|-}} and {{cog|oc|encara}}, {{cog|it|ancora}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{fr-IPA}}
* {{audio|fr|fr-encore.ogg|Audio (France)}}
* {{rhymes|fr|ɔʁ|s=2}}

===Adverb===
{{fr-adv}}

# {{l|en|still}}
#: {{syn|fr|toujours}}
#: {{uxi|fr|Êtes-vous '''encore''' là?|Are you '''still''' there?}}
# {{l|en|more}}
#: {{syn|fr|davantage}}
#: {{uxi|fr|Voulez-vous '''encore''' du pain ?|Would you like '''more''' bread?}}
#: {{uxi|fr|Tu en veux '''encore'''?|Do you want some '''more'''?}}
# {{l|en|again}}
#: {{syn|fr|à nouveau}}
#: {{uxi|fr|Écris-le [[encore une fois|'''encore''' une fois]]!|Write it once '''again'''!}}
# {{lb|fr|after the adverb {{m|fr|pas}}}} {{l|en|[[yet]], [[not yet]]}}
#: {{uxi|fr|Je n'ai [[pas encore|pas '''encore''']] fini.|I haven't finished '''yet'''.}}

